"<b>Pause Capture</b>"
"<br>Pause the packet-capture. With this command you will not capture any packet "
"till you don't decide to continue to capture them again."
msgstr ""
"<b>Tạm dừng bắt</b>"
"<br>Tạm dừng việc bắt gói tin. Lệnh này cho bạn có khả năng bắt gói tin riêng."

#: ksniffer.cpp:369
msgid "S&top"
